# SecNotes runtime dependencies. Compile the hash-locked requirements.txt with:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --output-file=app/requirements.txt app/requirements.in
# The Dockerfile installs with `pip install --require-hashes`, so a tampered or
# substituted package fails the build. Dependabot keeps both files current.
